    "identifier": "aburame-parasitic-destruction",
    "description": "<p>You send your swarm of insects to strike a creature in range, ignoring cover. Make a ranged ninjutsu attack dealing 4d6 poison (or Chakra, your choice) damage and they must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining a rank of Infested on a failed save.</p>\n<p>If you have your Swarm active when you cast this jutsu, you can make a second attack targeting the same or different creature. If a different creature, on a hit you deal your damage to the target as normal. If the same creature, on a hit, you increase the rank of Infested they gain by +1.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, damage by 1d6.</p>",
